[node name="Stars" type="HBoxContainer" parent="ArtMask/RankPlate"]
unique_name_in_owner = true
editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류 — CollectionCell.gd _fill_stars()
One %Star per rank up to the max rank (stars + breakthrough): code duplicates %Star and switches each one's variation (CollectionCellStarOn = reached rank / CollectionCellStar = unlocked, not reached). Nothing past the max rank."
